            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "SERA.1001 General ",
            "font_name": "Calibri-Bold",
            "font_size": 15.960000038146973,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.02400207519531,
              178.48995971679688,
              202.49696350097656,
              194.44996643066406
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "(a) ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.02400207519531,
              211.45999145507812,
              86.51904296875,
              222.49998474121094
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For flight over the high seas, the rules specified in Annex 2 to the Chicago Convention shall apply ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              211.45999145507812,
              525.865234375,
              222.49998474121094
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "without exception. For the purposes of continuity and seamless operation of air traffic services ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              224.89999389648438,
              525.7000732421875,
              235.9399871826172
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "in particular within Functional Airspace Blocks, the provisions of Annex 11 to the Chicago ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              238.33999633789062,
              525.6338500976562,
              249.37998962402344
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Convention may be applied in airspace over high seas in a manner that is consistent with how ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              251.77999877929688,
              525.746337890625,
              262.82000732421875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "those provisions are applied over the territory of the member States. This shall be without ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              265.2200012207031,
              525.600830078125,
              276.260009765625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "prejudice to the operations of State Aircraft under Article 3 of the Chicago Convention. This shall ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              278.6899719238281,
              525.8214721679688,
              289.72998046875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "also be without prejudice to the responsibilities of Member States to ensure that aircraft ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              292.0099792480469,
              525.6492919921875,
              303.04998779296875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "operations within the Flight Information Regions within which they are responsible for the ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              305.4499816894531,
              525.6449584960938,
              316.489990234375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "provision of air traffic services in accordance with ICAO regional air navigation agreements are ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              318.8899841308594,
              525.8567504882812,
              329.92999267578125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "undertaken in a safe, expeditious and efficient manner. ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              332.3299865722656,
              350.08502197265625,
              343.3699951171875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "(b) ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.02400207519531,
              351.7699890136719,
              86.99903869628906,
              362.80999755859375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "For those parts of the high seas where a Member State has accepted, pursuant to an ICAO ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              351.7699890136719,
              525.6007080078125,
              362.80999755859375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "regional air navigation agreement, the responsibility of providing air traffic services, the ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
              365.2099914550781,
              525.6339721679688,
              376.25
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Member State shall designate the ATS provider for providing those services. ",
            "font_name": "Calibri",
            "font_size": 11.039999961853027,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              100.33999633789062,
